# Local working material, deliberately not published.
# reference/ holds the job posting PDF and a design reference screenshot.
# This repo is public, so keeping them out avoids naming a specific employer
# on a site that is meant to stay brand-neutral.
reference/

# Generated on demand by the Download PDF button; not source.
Collin-Sadoff-Resume.pdf

# Raw video masters. These are source footage and full-quality renders, not
# web assets: they are far too large for git (GitHub rejects anything over
# 100MB) and far too large to serve. Compress them and host them on a
# streaming service instead - see README section 4.
Vids/
*.mp4
*.MP4
*.mov
*.MOV
*.braw
*.r3d

# ...but web-ready media under public/ IS meant to be committed: the short
# preview loops are only 1-3MB each and the site needs them at build time.
!public/**/*.mp4
!public/**/*.webm
